{"kind":"html","caption":"动画用示例 2 的 head = [1,2,3,4,5], k = 3 展示分组翻转: 先确认一组节点数量足够, 再逐条反转组内指针, 最后把新头和后继链表重新连接。节点 4、5 不足 3 个, 因此保持原有顺序；每个节点只被处理常数次, 时间复杂度为 O(n), 使用若干指针时额外空间为 O(1)。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>K 个一组翻转链表</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}\n.lead{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px}\n.mono{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.status{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-bottom:8px}\n.badge{padding:2px 7px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d;font-size:10px}\n.badge strong{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.progress{margin:8px 0;height:3px;background:#3c3c3c;border-radius:2px;overflow:hidden}\n.bar{height:100%;width:0;background:#3794ff;transition:width .35s}\n.chain{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:4px;min-height:56px}\n.node{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d;text-align:center;transition:background .35s,border-color .35s}\n.node.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}\n.node.fixed{border-style:dashed;opacity:.85}\n.value{font:600 14px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;margin-bottom:2px}\n.active .value{color:#fff}\n.index,.pointer{display:block;line-height:1.2;font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d}\n.pointer{min-height:14px;color:#3794ff;font-weight:600}\n.arrow{color:#8d8d8d;font:12px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.arrow.active{color:#3794ff}\n.note{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;line-height:1.45;font-size:11px;min-height:40px}\n.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 8px;margin-top:8px;font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d}\n.swatch{display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;margin-right:4px;border-radius:2px;background:#0e639c;border:1px solid #3794ff;vertical-align:-1px}\n.outline{background:#2d2d2d;border:1px dashed #8d8d8d}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>K 个一组翻转链表</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\"><span class=\"mono\">[1,2,3,4,5]</span>，k = 3</p>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"status\"><span class=\"badge\">步骤 <strong id=\"stepNo\">1 / 6</strong></span><span class=\"badge\">操作 <strong id=\"title\">划分第一组</strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"progress\"><div class=\"bar\" id=\"bar\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"chain\" id=\"chain\"></div>\n<div class=\"note\" id=\"note\"></div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"legend\"><span><i class=\"swatch\"></i>检查/修改</span><span><i class=\"swatch outline\"></i>不足 k 个</span><span>约 2.2s/步，自动循环</span></div>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst steps=[\n {title:'划分第一组',order:[1,2,3,4,5],active:[1,2,3],ptr:{1:'组首',3:'第 k 个'},note:'从组首向后检查 3 个节点。节点 1、2、3 数量足够，可以翻转这一整组。'},\n {title:'保存后继',order:[1,2,3,4,5],active:[3,4],ptr:{1:'curr',3:'组尾',4:'下一组起点'},note:'先记住节点 4。它是当前组之后的第一个节点，翻转完成后仍需把当前组接回它。'},\n {title:'反转组内指针',order:[3,2,1,4,5],active:[1,2,3],ptr:{3:'新组首',1:'新组尾'},reverse:true,note:'在组内依次改变 next 指向，连接方向由 1 → 2 → 3 变为 3 → 2 → 1。节点值始终没有改变。'},\n {title:'重新连接链表',order:[3,2,1,4,5],active:[1,3,4],ptr:{3:'head',1:'上一组尾',4:'下一组起点'},note:'让前驱指向新组首 3，再让新组尾 1 指向节点 4。第一组翻转和重连完成。'},\n {title:'检查剩余节点',order:[3,2,1,4,5],active:[4,5],fixed:[4,5],ptr:{4:'候选组首',5:'链表尾'},note:'剩余部分只有节点 4、5，共 2 个节点，小于 k = 3，不能组成完整的一组。'},\n {title:'得到最终结果',order:[3,2,1,4,5],active:[3,2,1],fixed:[4,5],ptr:{3:'新 head'},note:'最终链表为 [3,2,1,4,5]。不足 k 个的尾部保持 4 → 5 的原有顺序。'}\n];\nconst chain=document.getElementById('chain'),title=document.getElementById('title'),note=document.getElementById('note'),stepNo=document.getElementById('stepNo'),bar=document.getElementById('bar');\nlet current=0;\nfunction render(){\n const s=steps[current]; title.textContent=s.title; note.textContent=s.note; stepNo.textContent=(current+1)+' / '+steps.length; bar.style.width=((current+1)/steps.length*100)+'%'; chain.innerHTML='';\n s.order.forEach((v,i)=>{\n  const node=document.createElement('div'); node.className='node'+(s.active.includes(v)?' active':'')+((s.fixed||[]).includes(v)?' fixed':'');\n  node.innerHTML='<div class=\"value\">'+v+'</div><span class=\"index\">'+(v-1)+'</span><span class=\"pointer\">'+(s.ptr[v]||'&nbsp;')+'</span>'; chain.appendChild(node);\n  if(i<s.order.length-1){const a=document.createElement('div');a.className='arrow'+(s.active.includes(v)&&s.active.includes(s.order[i+1])?' active':'');a.textContent='→';chain.appendChild(a)}\n });\n}\nrender();setInterval(()=>{current=(current+1)%steps.length;render()},2200);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
